    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "peer support groups... what's the point of talking to other people who are also being crushed by the same machine? it doesn't change the fact that i have no place to live, no status, no future. it just feels like i'm waiting for a death that's already happening. the system has already decided i don't matter. why should i keep pretending that there's some other way to exist when the world has already closed all the doors? it feels like the only way to actually stop the machine from grinding me down is to just... stop being part of it.",
